solution:
**Given:**

(16 ÷ 8) × { 40 ÷ 2 + (11 ÷ 6) × (8 − 2) }

**Formula Used:**

Simplify brackets first

Multiply and divide from left to right

**Calculation:**

(16 ÷ 8) × { 40 ÷ 2 + (11 ÷ 6) × (8 − 2) }

⇒ (2) × { 20 + (11 ÷ 6) × (6) }

⇒ (2) × { 20 + 11 }

⇒ 2 × 31 = 62

**∴ The correct answer is 62.**
